 "remarks": "Carefree, convenient living defines this recently updated Condo with secluded patio/small yard & flexible upper level floor plan in Hawthorne complex very close to Glenville shopping & dining. Stylish 2020-2024 upgrades include freshly painted interior, new Quartz counters in kitchen, full baths; radiant heat kitchen floor and new living/dining room floors. Main level boasts eat-in kitchen with stainless appliances, open plan dining/living room with wood-burning fireplace, patio & half bath. The upper floors, with loft, provide options for multiple bedrooms including spacious primary suite and possible office. With attached garage & guest parking. Amenities include grounds care, snow & trash removal. Great location near Greenwich Ave., highways, airport, & Westchester",
